---

<section class="section how" id="how">
	<div class="wrap">
		<p class="eyebrow reveal">How it works</p>
		<h2 class="section-title reveal">Copy. Find. Paste.</h2>
		<div class="steps">
			<div class="step reveal">
				<div class="step-keys">
					<span class="kbd">Ctrl</span><span class="plus">+</span><span class="kbd">C</span>
				</div>
				<h3>Copy anywhere</h3>
				<p>
					Keep copying the way you always have. A background watcher notices every copy
					in about a fifth of a second and adds it to history: text, links, images,
					files, even rich HTML.
				</p>
			</div>
			<div class="step reveal">
				<div class="step-keys">
					<span class="type-demo">groups <span class="oc-chip" style="--cc:#14b8a6">work</span> <span class="oc-chip" style="--cc:#6366f1">ideas</span></span>
				</div>
				<h3>Find it later</h3>
				<p>
					Search by content or group name. Filter by type, date, group, or cloud state,
					and every filter shows how many items it would leave before you apply it.
				</p>
			</div>
			<div class="step reveal">
				<div class="step-keys">
					<span class="kbd">Ctrl</span><span class="plus">+</span><span class="kbd">Shift</span><span class="plus">+</span><span class="kbd">V</span>
				</div>
				<h3>Paste it back</h3>
				<p>
					A small popup opens at your cursor with your recent and pinned items. Press a
					number, 1 to 9, and that item is pasted into whatever app you are in.
				</p>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>

<style>
	.how {
	}

	.steps {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
		gap: 0.9rem;
		margin-top: 2.2rem;
	}

	.step {
		background: var(--surface);
		border: 1px solid var(--border);
		border-radius: var(--radius);
		padding: 1.15rem 1.2rem;
	}

	.step-keys {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 0.3rem;
		min-height: 30px;
		margin-bottom: 0.8rem;
	}

	.plus {
		color: var(--text-muted);
		font-size: 0.8rem;
	}

	.type-demo {
		font-family: var(--font-mono);
		font-size: 0.8rem;
		color: var(--text-secondary);
		display: inline-flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 0.4rem;
	}

	.step h3 {
		font-family: var(--font-display);
		font-size: 1.05rem;
		font-weight: 700;
		margin: 0 0 0.4rem;
		letter-spacing: -0.01em;
	}

	.step p {
		margin: 0;
		color: var(--text-secondary);
		font-size: 0.88rem;
	}

	@media (max-width: 820px) {
		.steps {
			grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
		}
	}
</style>
